01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:26,000
The Shack is a 2017 American fantasy drama film, directed by Stuart Hazeldine and written by
John Fusco, Andrew Lanham and Destin Daniel Cretton, based on the 2007 novel.

11
01:20:40,000 --> 01:20:46,000
The film stars Sam Worthington, Octavia Spencer, Avraham Aviv
Alush, Radha Mitchell, Alice Braga and Tim McGraw.

12
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The story follows a grieving father who, after suffering a family tragedy, receives a mysterious invitation to visit a shack
deep in the wilderness, where he confronts his darkest fears and experiences a transformative spiritual journey.

13
01:35:20,000 --> 01:35:26,000
Filming began on June 8, 2015, in Vancouver, British Columbia.

14
01:42:40,000 --> 01:42:46,000
The Shack was released in the United States on March 3, 2017.

15
01:50:00,000 --> 01:50:06,000
The film received unfavorable reviews from critics, but grossed
$96.9 million against a budget of $20 million.

